  "schema:name": "Amigo API JSON-LD context",
  "schema:description": "A JSON-LD @context for the objects Amigo's own API contract declares: one class per component schema, one property per declared field, typed from the contract. Derived by script (derive-json-ld.py, 2026-10-12) from openapi/amigo-account-api-openapi.yml, openapi/amigo-admin-api-openapi.yml, openapi/amigo-agent-definitions-api-openapi.yml.",
